sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Account/Upload UI
    participant H as SessionInfo health
    participant N as Local notifications
    participant Y as Direct upload
    UI->>H: read credentials.json
    H-->>UI: healthy/expiring/expired/unknown
    H->>N: deduplicated alert when needed
    alt expired
        H-->>Y: block before createvideo
    else usable or unknown
        UI->>Y: perform direct upload
        Y-->>UI: final provider result
    end
